{"id": "71920", "title": "朝暮成仙复来归", "author": "华衣临池", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 10, "available": 10, "cover": "files/article/image/71/71920/71920s.jpg", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/71/71920.htm", "intro": "属性分类：架空／其他／一般言情／感动揪心\n    关键字：叶珩羽 　叶真雨 　千一\n    文案：\n    她曾说过：不愿受生老病死、悲欢离合的轮回。若他无归期，便一人独活，不作鸳鸯只羡仙。\n    那时他只当玩笑话，可惜两人的爱情一年后物是人非。\n    三百年后，成仙之际，他以一生修为，保她长乐无忧；以奋身教导，铺她成仙之路。\n    他却是这么对她说：怕是不能爱你了。", "base": "files/article/html/71/71920", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "11319450.html", "available": true}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "11319451.html", "available": true}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "11319452.html", "available": true}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "11319453.html", "available": true}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "11319454.html", "available": true}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "11319455.html", "available": true}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "11319456.html", "available": true}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "11319457.html", "available": true}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "11319458.html", "available": true}, {"title": "46-48", "file": "11319459.html", "available": true}]}